// GITCRAFT API Discovery: describe a need → discover APIs → compare → integration guidance.
// The search rules mirror apidiscovery/search.py and every statement shown comes from templates generated by
// apidiscovery/intel.py and guide.py (data/apis.json), so the page cannot say what the tools would not.
